  "id": "ukrainian-beet-salad",
  "name": "Ukrainian Beet Salad",
  "subtitle": "A chilled mix of beets, root vegetables, peas, and pickles",
  "description": "Tender root vegetables are cooled, diced, and tossed with peas, pickles, onion, and a simple olive-oil seasoning.",
